  "construction": "One-block cyclic stabilizer code: generator X^a Z^b and its 34 cyclic shifts, a(x) = x^16 + x^18, b(x) = x^2 + x^5 + x^29 + x^32 in F_2[x]/(x^34 - 1); a = g p, b = g q with p, q palindromic so that a b* + b a* = 0; k = deg gcd(a, b, x^34 - 1)",
